@baseUrl = http://47.97.46.242/api/v1
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
@userToken = replace-with-user-access-token
@userId = replace-with-user-uuid
@planId = replace-with-plan-uuid
@quoteId = replace-with-quote-uuid
@orderId = replace-with-order-uuid
@refundId = replace-with-refund-uuid
@userVersion = 1
@planVersion = 1
@orderVersion = 1
@refundVersion = 1

### 创建停用方案（会员管理权限）
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/membership-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"cs30天会员","description":"cs会员购买与续期测试","durationDays":30,"priceCents":9900,"benefitCodes":["MEMBER_CONTENT"],"sortOrder":10}

### 记录上一步 id 与 version 后启用
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/membership-plans/{{planId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{planVersion}},"enabled":true}

### 公共可购买方案
GET {{baseUrl}}/membership-plans?keyword=cs&page=1&pageSize=20

### 管理方案（含停用）
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/membership-plans?keyword=cs&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 会员试算；保存返回 quoteId
POST {{baseUrl}}/order-quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"MEMBERSHIP","planId":"{{planId}}"}

### 创建订单；保存订单 id/version，每个新的购买意图使用新幂等键
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: cs-member-order-001

{"quoteId":"{{quoteId}}"}

### 管理员确认测试付款；无真实资金流，transactionNo 每单不同
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/test-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: cs-member-payment-001

{"version":{{orderVersion}},"transactionNo":"cs_member_payment_001"}

### 当前网站会员资格
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/membership
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 本人购买权益段（ACTIVE 状态仍须结合 startsAt/expiresAt 判断）
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/membership/periods?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 续期：重复试算、下单、付款，使用新 quoteId/订单 ID/幂等键/transactionNo
### 支付后第二段从第一段结束时间追加；不会再次从当前时间覆盖第一段
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/membership/periods?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 查询未来段对应订单，读取最新 version
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 仅未来未开始完整会员段可退款；当前生效段预期 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/digital-refund
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: cs-member-refund-001

{"orderVersion":{{orderVersion}},"reason":"cs未来续费段退款测试"}

### 保存受理返回的 refund.id/version，确认成功（可改 FAILED 验证恢复）
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/refunds/{{refundId}}/test-result
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: cs-member-refund-result-001

{"version":{{refundVersion}},"result":"SUCCEEDED"}

### 先读本人资料版本
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 更新昵称；头像可省略，地址必须指向实际存在的 OSS 对象
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{userVersion}},"nickname":"cs会员测试用户","avatarUrl":"https://chunai-photo.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/avatars/replace-with-existing-object.jpg"}

### 清空头像；更新为上一步返回的新 version
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{userVersion}},"avatarUrl":null}

### 管理用户搜索（users:read）
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?keyword=cs&status=ACTIVE&hasMembership=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 用户详情始终返回脱敏手机；记录最新 version
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 封禁会立即撤销该用户全部会话（users:ban）
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/ban
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: cs-user-ban-test-001

{"version":{{userVersion}},"reason":"cs封禁权限验证"}

### 用封禁响应的新 version 解封；之后用户必须重新登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/unban
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: cs-user-unban-test-001

{"version":{{userVersion}},"reason":"cs解封验证完成"}
